        "paragraph_id": "49BF1ED5",
        "text": "In a longshore uniform situation, according to Snell’s law, the first term on the right-hand side equals zero; the second term exactly equals the sum of the wave energy dissipation and the roller energy input and dissipation terms, so the forcing term reduces to:"
      }
    ],
